<% content_for :title, "Privacy notice · VIVUM Plants" %>

<header class="grid gap-1">
  <p class="vv-kicker">Version <%= @purpose.version %> · Draft</p>
  <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
</header>

<p>
  VIVUM Labs runs VIVUM Plants and is responsible for your personal information
  under the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA). This notice explains
  what we collect, why, who helps us process it, and your rights.
</p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>

<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Account details:</strong> your email address and a scrambled
    (hashed) version of your password.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>What you add:</strong> plant records, photos, care logs, setups and
    notes.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Selling and buying:</strong> orders, stock and buyer details that
    sellers record to run their business.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Security records:</strong> when you sign in, change security
    settings or agree to something, we keep your IP address and browser details
    (user agent) with the event. Security events are kept for two years to
    protect accounts and investigate misuse; they identify you by account
    number, not by name or email.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Your choices:</strong> a history of what you've agreed to and when.
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>Why we use it</h2>

<ul>
  <li>To run your account and the features you use.</li>
  <li>To keep the service and your account secure.</li>
  <li>To send account, security and order emails.</li>

  <li>
    With your permission only: news and offers, AI assistance and WhatsApp
    reminders.
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>Who processes it for us</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Resend</strong> sends our emails.</li>

  <li>
    <strong>Anthropic and OpenAI</strong> process the plant details and messages
    you choose to send, only when AI assistance is on. Under their API terms,
    they don't use it to train their models.
  </li>

  <li>
    <strong>Meta (WhatsApp)</strong> delivers reminders and messages, only when
    you turn them on.
  </li>

  <li><strong>Paystack</strong> handles seller subscription payments.</li>
  <li>Our hosting provider stores the service's data.</li>
</ul>

<p>
  Some of these providers process data outside South Africa. We only use
  providers that protect it to a standard POPIA accepts.
</p>

<h2>Your choices and rights</h2>

<ul>
  <li>
    Turn news, AI assistance and WhatsApp reminders on or off at any time in
    Settings → Privacy. It takes effect straight away.
  </li>

  <li>
    Ask for a copy of your information, or ask us to correct or delete it.
  </li>

  <li>
    Object to how we use it, or complain to the Information Regulator
    (inforegulator.org.za).
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>How long we keep it</h2>

<p>
  We keep your information while your account is open. When you close it, we
  delete your account, content and consent history, except security records
  (kept for two years) and anything the law requires us to keep, such as tax
  invoices.
</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>

<p>
  When this notice changes, we'll ask you to read and accept the new version
  before you continue.
</p>
